	(text "J2 - board component view, footprint at 0 deg\n                 6:SCL       5:EN        4:TP2\n                 3:SDA       2:GND       1:TP1\nPin 1 is lower right; preserve the footprint key outline.\nNumbering matches bitcrane J10, NOT HCTL numbering.\nDo not substitute a standard-numbered footprint."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
